# Uploaded media — **kept in the repository, deliberately.**
#
# This was `backend/uploads/`, and it was excluding 337 real files: the
# congregation's photographs, their thumbnails and video, in
# `backend/uploads/{images,thumbs,videos}`. They are the church's own media —
# among the hardest things on this project to replace, and in several cases
# irreplaceable — so they are versioned with everything else rather than living
# only on whichever machine happens to be serving.
#
# The trade-off is a larger repository. That is the cheaper of the two risks.

